</para>
<sect1 id="builtin__history_8c_1autotoc_md0_1s1"><sect2 id="builtin__history_8c_1autotoc_md0">
<title>Notes</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>history_list() returns a NULL-terminated array of HIST_ENTRY* (readline).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>history_base is the number assigned to the first entry (typically 1).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>history_length is the total number of entries currently in the list. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
